{%- comment -%}
PFC Daily Pulse — last night's levers vs target, the verdict, and tonight's one
move. Data comes pre-digested from pulse.pulse_snapshot via build_pfc_pulse;
templates only print. Thresholds live in automations/scripts/pulse.py (bands
overridable under `health.pulse` in config/automation_config.yaml) — tune them
there, never here.

Status is the colour spelled out in caps, never emoji (e-ink has no emoji
font): RED / YELLOW / GREEN / NO DATA. Not punctuation marks — those need a
legend, and a legend that isn't on the screen is a legend nobody has.

Levers render worst-first: red, then yellow, then green. Tier only breaks
ties within a colour. See AGENTS.md § "Metrics point one direction".
{%- endcomment -%}
